SUMMARY:Third Sunday Showcase Sesh - Craig Caffall Album Release Party
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Craig Caffall’s new album with a night of rootsy rock\, blues\, and storytelling at the Third Sunday Showcase Sesh.\nThe Third Sunday Showcase Sesh returns May 17 with a special album release celebration for Bay Area singer\, songwriter\, and guitarist Craig Caffall. Backed by the Craig Caffall Band\, Caffall brings his signature blend of rock\, blues\, and roots music to the stage\, showcasing songs from his newest release Chasing the Moon to Reno alongside fan favorites from a decades-long career. \nWith more than 50 years in music and collaborations with legends including Bonnie Raitt\, Bo Diddley\, John Mayall\, and Maria Muldaur\, Caffall delivers a seasoned performance full of energy\, storytelling\, and soulful musicianship. The evening opens with singer-songwriter Sebastian St. James\, setting the stage for a memorable night of live music. \nTickets: $15 \nDoors open 6:30pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/third-sunday-showcase-sesh-craig-caffall-album-release-party/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
