DESCRIPTION:Willy is a magnificent vocalist who brings large doses of honesty\, energy and an incredible feeling.\nBlues Defenders hosts a weekly concert with headliners and swing dancing. Tonight’s headliner is Willy Jordan.\nWilly has performed and/or recorded with Elvin Bishop\, Frank Morgan\, Charlie Musselwhite\, and Carlos Santana. He is currently member\, drummer\, and primary singer with Elvin Bishop\, and Lead in Anthony Paule soul orchestra. \nDoors open at 5pm Show Starts at 6pm. Tickets $15 online. $18 at door. $12 for members. No food service.
