SUMMARY:Freestyle and Freedom
DESCRIPTION:LaiddBackZach (LBZ) is a genre-blending recording and performing artist known for fusing hip-hop\, funk\, soul\, and R&B\, into a sound that hits both the soul and the dance floor. LBZ brings a vibrant\, groove-heavy experience that keeps crowds moving and locked in. Coming from a background of poetry and a love for the stage\, LBZ has a presence that makes the stage feel like home. Now\, to support a special cause they are partnering with Audacity Rising Inc. to help raise funds to benefit VIDAS who provides legal representation and family aid to our immigrant communities in these challenging times.
