SUMMARY:LaiddBackZach and The Wav "Freestyle and Freedom"
DESCRIPTION:$30 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:30pm with one intermission \nEarlybirds!\n$3 off each ticket when you use the code earlybird17 at checkout. Offer ends May 17th.\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word. \nThis is a benefit concert in conjunction with Audacity Rising Inc. to benefit the VIDAS law group serving the immigrant community. \nLaiddBackZach (LBZ) is a genre-blending recording and performing artist known for fusing hip-hop\, funk\, soul\, and R&B\, into a sound that hits both the soul and the dance floor. LBZ brings a vibrant\, groove-heavy experience that keeps crowds moving and locked in. Coming from a background of poetry and a love for the stage\, LBZ has a presence that makes the stage feel like home. Now\, to support a special cause they are partnering with Audacity Rising Inc. to help raise funds to benefit VIDAS who provides legal representation and family aid to our immigrant communities in these challenging times. \nLBZ – The Real Swap Meet (Music Video) https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=luMpmCEGUmY&list=RDluMpmCEGUmY&start_radio=1 https://www.facebook.com/LaiddBackZach/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/laiddbackzach/ \nRecommended If You Like: The Roots
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/laiddbackzach-and-the-wav-freestyle-and-freedom/
